Email Delivery (Resend + Custom Domain)
==================================================

Production email provider
- [x] Custom domain `picha-restaurant.com` verified in Resend (SPF/DKIM DNS)
- [x] `EMAIL_FROM=Picha <noreply@picha-restaurant.com>`
- [x] Migrated from Mailtrap sandbox to Resend for production delivery

Render SMTP fix → Resend HTTP API
- [x] Root cause: Render blocks outbound SMTP (ports 25/465/587) → `ETIMEDOUT` on `CONN`
- [x] Production now sends via Resend HTTP API (`https://api.resend.com/emails`, port 443)
- [x] Sandbox/local still uses Mailtrap SMTP when `EMAIL_MODE=sandbox`
- [x] New env: `RESEND_API_KEY` (falls back to legacy `SMTP_PASS` for same `re_...` key)
- [x] `backend/utils/emailService.js` — `sendViaResendApi()`, `deliver()`, fast SMTP timeouts in sandbox
- [x] Startup log: `transport=resend-http-api apiKey=set|(unset)`
- [x] `npm run email:test` — diagnostics script for transport + send test

Registration resilience
- [x] Register returns `201` with `emailSent: true|false` instead of `502` on send failure
- [x] Pending record kept either way; user can resend from waiting room
- [x] Structured logs: `register_verification_email_failed` with SMTP/API error detail

