6 Jul 2026 — Kitchen/Staff Rate Limits + Auth Logging
==================================================

Rate limiting fix
- [x] Removed `authLimiter` from `/api/staff` and `/api/kitchen` — was counting kitchen queue polling and SSE as login attempts, causing 429 spam ("Too many authentication attempts")
- [x] Added `operationalLimiter` for staff/kitchen dashboards (`RATE_LIMIT_OPERATIONAL_*`, default 180 req/min)
- [x] Applied `writeLimiter` on staff/kitchen mutating routes (check-in, create order, kitchen order/stock PATCH)
- [x] `backend/.env.example` — `RATE_LIMIT_OPERATIONAL_WINDOW_MS`, `RATE_LIMIT_OPERATIONAL_MAX`

Frontend kitchen stream
- [x] Stabilized `useKitchenStream` callbacks with `useCallback` in `KitchenQueue`, `KitchenReservations`, `StaffStatus`, `AdminKitchenSection` — prevents SSE reconnect on every re-render

Security / dev hygiene
- [x] Removed debug `console.log` from `AuthContext.jsx` — login/register responses no longer print JWT in browser DevTools

