- [x] Updated security and architecture documentation for HttpOnly cookie authentication

==================================================
Known Issues / Ops Notes
==================================================

- Resend "delivered" but inbox empty → usually spam filtering on new sending domain; check junk + add DMARC
- Resend DKIM/return-path CNAME records must be DNS-only (grey cloud) in Cloudflare — not proxied
- Cloudflare proxy on API is optional; does not affect outbound email; use SSL Full (strict) if proxied
- Render: set `RESEND_API_KEY` on redeploy; remove unused `SMTP_HOST`/`SMTP_PORT`/`SMTP_USER`

